# MCP 2025-11-25 style session-bound Streamable HTTP flow
# Based on the article's before example.

POST /mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-11-25",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "my-app",
      "version": "1.0"
    }
  }
}

### Subsequent request carries Mcp-Session-Id

POST /mcp HTTP/1.1
Mcp-Session-Id: 1868a90c-3a3f-4f5b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "search",
    "arguments": {
      "q": "otters"
    }
  }
}
